.\VERCEL_DEPLOYMENT.md:20:### 1. It Needs to Run Continuously (Background Worker)
.\VERCEL_DEPLOYMENT.md:21:A LiveKit worker operates by opening a continuous, persistent connection to the LiveKit Cloud. It sits there, 24/7, waiting for the LiveKit Cloud to say "Hey, I have a phone call for you to answer." 
.\VERCEL_DEPLOYMENT.md:22:Vercel cannot run persistent background workers. If you try to run `agent.py start` on Vercel, it will run for 10 seconds, and then Vercel will terminate the process. Your agent would go completely offline.
